{"id":"61744098b3a465ad","group":"58","path":"58/batch06/58-df-zfc-game-tree.md","title":"ZFC Game Tree","display":"df-zfc-game-tree — ZFC Game Tree","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-game-tree","aliases":["58-df-zfc-game-tree"],"display":"df-zfc-game-tree — ZFC Game Tree","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-function-restriction]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-game-tree"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-game-tree</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-game-tree — ZFC Game Tree"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"cfb4df0f853ccdd7\" href=\"?note=cfb4df0f853ccdd7\" title=\"58-df-function-restriction\">58-df-function-restriction</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> (ambient formal setting)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T,A\\in V\">\\(T,A\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\\upharpoonright n\">\\(s\\upharpoonright n\\)</span> (set-function restriction, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"cfb4df0f853ccdd7\" href=\"?note=cfb4df0f853ccdd7\" title=\"58-df-function-restriction\">58-df-function-restriction</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GameTree}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{GameTree}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}game\\text{-}tree} \\vdash \\mathrm{GameTree}_S(T,A) \\leftrightarrow T\\neq\\emptyset\\land T\\subseteq\\omega^{&lt;\\omega}\\land\\forall s\\in T\\;\\forall n\\leq\\operatorname{dom}(s)\\;(s\\upharpoonright n\\in T)\\land A\\subseteq\\{x\\in\\omega^\\omega\\mid\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(x\\upharpoonright n\\in T)\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}game\\text{-}tree} \\vdash \\mathrm{GameTree}_S(T,A) \\leftrightarrow T\\neq\\emptyset\\land T\\subseteq\\omega^{&lt;\\omega}\\land\\forall s\\in T\\;\\forall n\\leq\\operatorname{dom}(s)\\;(s\\upharpoonright n\\in T)\\land A\\subseteq\\{x\\in\\omega^\\omega\\mid\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(x\\upharpoonright n\\in T)\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> is a nonempty prefix-closed tree of finite plays, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> is a payoff set of infinite branches; the formerly unexplained notation <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[T]\">\\([T]\\)</span> is expanded.</li>\n<li>The assertion is the complete sequence-tree definition; unrelated abstract game/tree predicates are not imported.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-function-restriction","status":"resolved","id":"cfb4df0f853ccdd7","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-function-restriction]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-function-restriction","status":"resolved","id":"cfb4df0f853ccdd7","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$s\\upharpoonright n$ (set-function restriction, see [[58-df-function-restriction]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"T,A\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"s\\upharpoonright n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{GameTree}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}game\\text{-}tree} \\vdash \\mathrm{GameTree}_S(T,A) \\leftrightarrow T\\neq\\emptyset\\land T\\subseteq\\omega^{<\\omega}\\land\\forall s\\in T\\;\\forall n\\leq\\operatorname{dom}(s)\\;(s\\upharpoonright n\\in T)\\land A\\subseteq\\{x\\in\\omega^\\omega\\mid\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(x\\upharpoonright n\\in T)\\}","display":true},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"[T]","display":false}],"bytes":1108,"backlinks":[{"id":"a1a1dc70da0d9f61","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{GameTree}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[../batch06/58-df-zfc-game-tree.md]])"},{"id":"da76983f71a491b6","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2157","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch06/58-df-zfc-game-tree.md|58-df-zfc-game-tree]]（batch06）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","cfb4df0f853ccdd7"]}